    {
     "t": "accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "What is included in the $950 Business Starter Package?",
       "a": "<p>A custom logo (JPG and PNG), a basic single-page multi-section responsive website, 150 business cards, Google Business Profile setup, a free domain and hosting for the first year, Google Search Console submission and free website maintenance for the first year.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "What does the website cost after the first year?",
       "a": "<p>From the second year, website maintenance is $250 per year for updates and small edits, and an optional yearly backup is $50.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Will my website work on phones?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. Every site is designed to be responsive, so it adjusts to phones, tablets and desktop screens.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can you redesign my existing website?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We can refresh an older site so it matches your current logo and brand and works properly on mobile devices. Contact us with your current site address for a quote.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can you guarantee first-page Google rankings?",
       "a": "<p>No. Rankings depend on competition and ongoing SEO, so no specific position can be guaranteed. We do set up the basics, such as Search Console submission and Google Business Profile in the starter package.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do I need a logo before you build my website?",
       "a": "<p>It helps, but it is not required. The starter package includes a custom logo, and if you already have a logo made with AI we can clean it up for web use first.</p>"
      }
